>> title: Blondies
>> category: Bars & Brownies
>> tags: brown sugar, butterscotch, dessert, oven
>> servings: 9
>> time: 45 min

Line an #8x8-in pan{} with parchment.

Preheat the #oven{} to 350°F (175°C).

Melt @unsalted butter{1/2%cup}(115 g) in a #saucepan{}.

Beat @&(~1)melted butter{} with @dark brown sugar{1%cup}(200 g), @table salt{1/2%tsp}(3 g).

Whisk @&(~1)mixture{} with @egg{1%large}(50 g), @egg yolk{1%large}(20 g), and @vanilla extract{2%tsp}(10 mL).

Fold @all-purpose flour{1%cup}(130 g), @baking powder{1/2%tsp}(2 g), @toasted pecans{3/4%cup}(85 g), @butterscotch chips{1/2%cup}(90 g) into @&(~1)batter{}.

Bake @&(~1)batter{} at 350°F for ~{25%min}.
